{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Use case: stylized-concept. Create a landscape 3:2 Minecraft builder reference sheet, crisp voxel style, plain light background, vanilla Minecraft blocks only, no characters or animals. Two views side by side: LEFT straight-on front elevation, orthographic; RIGHT front-right three-quarter view at exactly the same scale. Show the same house consistently. Skilled human builder quality, actual block-grid massing and depth, projecting trim and recessed framed openings, roofs with verges, eaves and ridges, stairs/slabs/fences/walls/trapdoors/lantern details. No smooth non-voxel curves. Small labels FRONT ELEVATION and THREE-QUARTER; name key materials using exact block ids.\\n\\nSite: suburban McMansion viewed from a cul-de-sac street, within a 44-block-wide by 32-block-deep lot, 14 blocks tall to highest ridge, two storeys plus attic, lawn, driveway and rear deck. Tall white-trimmed front gable is the highest point over a two-storey portico: four white quartz columns on a shallow porch, black double front door, stepped fanlight arch, tall stepped arched window above, black-shuttered windows either side, brass-black carriage lanterns. West/left three-car garage wing projects toward street, three wide cream panelled carriage doors with glass panes at top and black strap hinges, gray stone-veneer piers, long concrete driveway, two gable dormers on low dark roof over bonus room. Right of portico a projecting turret bay with tall arched windows, stepped conical roof and slim finial. East wing steps back under hip roof; large gray stone chimney on front wall between shuttered windows. Street-side lower walls stone veneer; upper floors beige lap siding, white bands, cornices, sills and alternating corner quoins. All dark asphalt-like shingle roofs, jumble of hips/gables/dormers/cone. Manicured lawn, foundation azalea hedges with small flowers, young staked birch on right lawn, lamp posts beside two-block-wide stone walk and porch steps, kerb, sidewalk, asphalt street. Rear wooden deck with railing, steps, patio table, chairs and grill behind kitchen French doors; show only what is naturally visible in the right view, do not add extra views or cutaways. Interior planned behind facade: double-height foyer, sweeping dark-oak staircase, hanging chandelier, open kitchen island/family room with stone fireplace and big TV, formal dining, office, garage mudroom; upstairs primary suite/closet/bath, three bedrooms, garage bonus room. Do not expose rooms unnaturally.\\n\\nExact allowed block palette by role (choose relevant blocks; the palette is not a requirement to display every object): {\\\"stone veneer\\\":[\\\"stone_bricks\\\",\\\"andesite\\\",\\\"cobblestone\\\",\\\"stone_brick_stairs\\\",\\\"stone_brick_slab\\\",\\\"stone_brick_wall\\\",\\\"cobblestone_wall\\\"],\\\"beige siding\\\":[\\\"smooth_sandstone\\\",\\\"sandstone\\\",\\\"smooth_sandstone_stairs\\\",\\\"smooth_sandstone_slab\\\",\\\"sandstone_stairs\\\",\\\"sandstone_slab\\\"],\\\"white trim\\\":[\\\"smooth_quartz\\\",\\\"quartz_block\\\",\\\"quartz_pillar\\\",\\\"chiseled_quartz_block\\\",\\\"quartz_stairs\\\",\\\"smooth_quartz_stairs\\\",\\\"quartz_slab\\\",\\\"smooth_quartz_slab\\\",\\\"quartz_bricks\\\"],\\\"roof\\\":[\\\"deepslate_tiles\\\",\\\"deepslate_tile_stairs\\\",\\\"deepslate_tile_slab\\\",\\\"cobbled_deepslate\\\",\\\"cobbled_deepslate_stairs\\\",\\\"cobbled_deepslate_slab\\\",\\\"blackstone\\\",\\\"blackstone_stairs\\\",\\\"blackstone_slab\\\",\\\"polished_blackstone\\\",\\\"polished_blackstone_slab\\\",\\\"polished_blackstone_stairs\\\",\\\"polished_blackstone_bricks\\\",\\\"polished_blackstone_brick_stairs\\\",\\\"polished_blackstone_brick_slab\\\",\\\"polished_deepslate\\\",\\\"polished_deepslate_slab\\\",\\\"polished_deepslate_stairs\\\"],\\\"black accents\\\":[\\\"dark_oak_trapdoor\\\",\\\"dark_oak_door\\\",\\\"dark_oak_fence\\\",\\\"dark_oak_planks\\\",\\\"dark_oak_stairs\\\",\\\"dark_oak_slab\\\",\\\"dark_oak_fence_gate\\\",\\\"iron_bars\\\",\\\"polished_blackstone_slab\\\",\\\"black_concrete\\\"],\\\"glass\\\":[\\\"glass_pane\\\",\\\"glass\\\",\\\"white_stained_glass_pane\\\"],\\\"interior wood/floors\\\":[\\\"oak_planks\\\",\\\"spruce_planks\\\",\\\"birch_planks\\\",\\\"birch_door\\\",\\\"birch_trapdoor\\\",\\\"oak_stairs\\\",\\\"spruce_stairs\\\",\\\"spruce_slab\\\",\\\"oak_slab\\\",\\\"oak_door\\\",\\\"oak_trapdoor\\\",\\\"oak_fence\\\",\\\"bookshelf\\\",\\\"smooth_stone\\\",\\\"polished_andesite\\\",\\\"gray_concrete\\\",\\\"light_gray_concrete\\\",\\\"light_gray_terracotta\\\",\\\"white_terracotta\\\",\\\"gray_terracotta\\\",\\\"stone\\\",\\\"spruce_trapdoor\\\"],\\\"ground / paving\\\":[\\\"grass_block\\\",\\\"coarse_dirt\\\",\\\"gravel\\\",\\\"polished_andesite\\\",\\\"polished_andesite_stairs\\\",\\\"polished_andesite_slab\\\",\\\"light_gray_concrete\\\",\\\"gray_concrete\\\",\\\"black_concrete\\\",\\\"stone\\\",\\\"andesite\\\",\\\"smooth_stone\\\",\\\"smooth_stone_slab\\\"],\\\"plants\\\":[\\\"azalea_leaves\\\",\\\"flowering_azalea_leaves\\\",\\\"birch_log\\\",\\\"birch_leaves\\\",\\\"oak_leaves\\\",\\\"short_grass\\\",\\\"fern\\\",\\\"allium\\\",\\\"pink_tulip\\\",\\\"red_tulip\\\",\\\"white_tulip\\\",\\\"azure_bluet\\\",\\\"cornflower\\\",\\\"poppy\\\",\\\"peony\\\",\\\"rose_bush\\\",\\\"lilac\\\",\\\"potted_azalea_bush\\\",\\\"potted_fern\\\",\\\"potted_allium\\\",\\\"potted_red_tulip\\\",\\\"potted_poppy\\\",\\\"potted_cornflower\\\",\\\"flower_pot\\\"],\\\"lights\\\":[\\\"lantern\\\",\\\"copper_lantern\\\",\\\"iron_chain\\\",\\\"copper_chain\\\",\\\"end_rod\\\",\\\"candle\\\",\\\"white_candle\\\",\\\"campfire\\\",\\\"lightning_rod\\\"],\\\"furniture/functional\\\":[\\\"white_bed\\\",\\\"red_bed\\\",\\\"blue_bed\\\",\\\"gray_bed\\\",\\\"light_blue_bed\\\",\\\"white_carpet\\\",\\\"gray_carpet\\\",\\\"light_gray_carpet\\\",\\\"brown_carpet\\\",\\\"red_carpet\\\",\\\"blue_carpet\\\",\\\"crafting_table\\\",\\\"furna